def run_one(mesh, target, out, P, board=True):
    """30 October 2026 : split = off | on | auto. auto = mesh the whole input first (best for a single piece or a hard surface assembly : QuadWild keeps the creases across pieces) and, only when the coverage gate is red (a piece lost or fused), mesh component by component and keep the better pass."""
